19:48:00.584 database C:\MapleCW\maplecw.db
19:48:00.584 NOT AUTHENTICATED: a migration seed is a u32, so it identifies a pending
19:48:00.585   migration rather than proving who is on the far end. It is single-use.
19:48:00.585 SET-FIELD PROBE IS ON - which by now means 'the channel answers at all'. The
19:48:00.585   flag is a misnomer kept for the launch line: without it Session::handle
19:48:00.586   returns nothing for every packet, so the migration hello goes unanswered and
19:48:00.586   the client freezes on 'Connecting...'.
19:48:00.586   With it on, this channel answers: the migration hello with a SetField
19:48:00.586   carrying the character's real record (presence[0] the stat block, presence[2]
19:48:00.586   the equipped list), 0x00DC with that field's NPCs and mobs, 0x00D1 with the
19:48:00.586   portal's destination, 0x00E7 with the !map GM command, and 0x0151 with a
19:48:00.586   script Say. Equipment, mobs and the Say are BUILT BUT UNCONFIRMED on screen.
